  "question": {
    "text": "If the equations <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> have a common root, then <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
